target: internal/record/record.go
verify: go test ./internal/record/ -count=1 -run 'TestLoadsStructuralRulesThatNothingElseAsserts'
expect: was treated as a cycle row and appended
why:    the whitespace sibling of the case-folding entry. ` cycle` is not `cycle` to the Python, which merges it instead of appending it, so trimming here appends a row the oracle does not and forges the same converged verdict. Separate entry because the two are separate edits and a reader fixing one would not see the other.
--- old
		if phase != "cycle" {
--- new
		phase = strings.TrimSpace(phase)
		if phase != "cycle" {
